":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: You're taking this very calmly."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":297},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-05-11"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: I'm not calm."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":298},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-05-12"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: You're making jokes with someone we don't know."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":299},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-05-13"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: I also made a joke with a delivery driver this morning."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":300},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-05-14"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: It didn't make him my best friend."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":301},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-05-15"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: That's not the same thing."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":302},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-05-16"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: No. It isn't."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":303},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-05-17"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: But being polite isn't permission to share everything with someone."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":304},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-05-18"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Good."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":305},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-05-20"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: The person you're discussing is still here, you know."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":306},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-05-21"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I know."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":307},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-05-22"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Then perhaps stop talking about them like furniture."}