 don't want you to leave because we can't agree on something."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":355},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-C08-a-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: You can decide that yourself. Not under pressure."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":356},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-C08-a-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I wouldn't stop you."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":357},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-08-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: I think that's enough about the invitation."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":358},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-08-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Could we agree to stop treating possibilities like facts, too?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":359},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-08-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Such as?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":360},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-08-4"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: The timeline."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":361},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-08-6"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Maya."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":362},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-08-7"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: I'm not going into it here."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":363},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-08-8"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: I just don't want a repeat of yesterday."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":364},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-08-9"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Yesterday happened because somebody said they'd seen Daniel later than anyone else."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":365},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-08-10"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: We said we'd check that properly."}}