ncluding what I say about myself."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'm not some impartial narrator here."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'm his sister."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"And right now I want anything that might bring him home to mean something."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'm glad you stayed, Alex."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I keep coming back to the number I found."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Your number."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I don't want to turn it into something it isn't."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4201/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"But I can't make myself ignore it either."]]],[[181,4