oup-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I didn't bring you here because I thought you were a detective."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I don't know what you do. You don't have to tell me."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I just thought somebody outside all of this might notice when we're getting ahead of ourselves."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4201/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Maybe you've noticed already."]]],[[193,469]]],["DIV",{"class":"opening-actions opening-v4-composer"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-action-heading"},"Choose a reply"],["DIV",{"class":"scene01-options"},["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},"I can try to help."],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},"I'm not a detective, Sophie."],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},"I still don't know if I trust you."],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},"What do you actually want me to do?"],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"14","height":"14","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-star","aria-label":"Premium"},[