 than that."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"There's something I haven't shown you yet."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Not a private file or anything."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"A public article."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"People have been sharing it since Daniel stopped answering."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"It talks about him as if it explains everything."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Maybe it does to some people."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"It doesn't to me."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'll find the link when I've had a chance to rest."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I don't think I can talk about it properly tonight."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4201/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"And I want you to read it without me telling you what to think first."]]],[[205,469]]],["DIV",{"class":"opening-actions opening-v4-composer"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-action-heading"},"Choose a reply"],["DIV",{"class":"scene01-options"},["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},"That's fine. No rush."],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},"You should get some sleep."],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},"I'm glad you told me about Daniel."],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},"I'll keep an open mind about the article."],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"14","height":"14","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-star","aria-label":"Premium"},["path",{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"}]],"I think he'd laugh at how hard you were trying not to worry everybody tonight."]],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-primary","disabled":""},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoi